00:23:54.060 --> 00:23:56.050
another one really going after the woke

00:23:56.050 --> 00:23:57.943
and they picked him up as well.

00:23:59.175 --> 00:24:00.520
What is it that you want people

00:24:00.520 --> 00:24:02.040
to mainly take away from this?

00:24:02.040 --> 00:24:04.500
I mean, is it just so that they understand

00:24:04.500 --> 00:24:05.670
the issues better?

00:24:05.670 --> 00:24:07.760
Like, what do you want
the average person to do

00:24:07.760 --> 00:24:09.830
after they read this book?

00:24:09.830 --> 00:24:12.288
- Well, I want them to
say that first of all,

00:24:12.288 --> 00:24:14.600
there's no reason we
have to accept the power

00:24:14.600 --> 00:24:16.763
of these tech monopolies, we
don't just have to accept it.

00:24:16.763 --> 00:24:19.280
I think that's often what we're told.

00:24:19.280 --> 00:24:20.500
This is just how it is.

00:24:20.500 --> 00:24:23.230
And if you use these platforms

00:24:23.230 --> 00:24:25.410
as overwhelming majorities
of Americans do,

00:24:25.410 --> 00:24:26.420
you're just gonna have to get used to

00:24:26.420 --> 00:24:28.000
having your data taken from you.

00:24:28.000 --> 00:24:30.620
And you're just gonna have
to get used to being spied on

00:24:30.620 --> 00:24:31.500
all over the web.

00:24:31.500 --> 00:24:32.540
And you're just gonna have to get used to

00:24:32.540 --> 00:24:34.870
your children being tracked,
and that's just our economy,

00:24:34.870 --> 00:24:35.703
that's how it is.

00:24:35.703 --> 00:24:36.860
It's not how it has to be.

00:24:36.860 --> 00:24:37.693
It's not at all.

00:24:37.693 --> 00:24:39.230
We can do something about that.

00:24:39.230 --> 00:24:40.980
These tech companies got big and powerful

00:24:40.980 --> 00:24:42.300
with the help of government,

00:24:42.300 --> 00:24:44.180
now it's time to cut them down to size

00:24:44.180 --> 00:24:45.460
and restore the free market.

00:24:45.460 --> 00:24:47.020
So I think that's the message.

00:24:47.020 --> 00:24:48.810
I want people to feel
a sense of empowerment

00:24:48.810 --> 00:24:50.490
that things can be different

00:24:50.490 --> 00:24:52.870
and they will be
different if we demand it.

00:24:52.870 --> 00:24:55.800
And also we've got some
control in our own lives.

00:24:55.800 --> 00:24:58.920
We need to address this situation
politically and legally.

00:24:58.920 --> 00:25:01.110
We need to cut these
companies down to size,

00:25:01.110 --> 00:25:02.780
but also personally,

00:25:02.780 --> 00:25:04.610
we can do things that
we'll take back control.

00:25:04.610 --> 00:25:06.410
We can spend less time on the platforms,

00:25:06.410 --> 00:25:08.360
we can take steps that
will limit their ability

00:25:08.360 --> 00:25:09.367
to spy on us,

00:25:09.367 --> 00:25:11.550
and we can try to get them
out of our children's lives.

00:25:11.550 --> 00:25:13.070
And I share about some
of that in the book.

00:25:13.070 --> 00:25:14.060
- Yeah. I don't know if you know this,

00:25:14.060 --> 00:25:16.840
but I do every August off the grid,

00:25:16.840 --> 00:25:20.270
no phone, no computer,
no news, no nothing.

00:25:20.270 --> 00:25:22.530
And I honestly think
it's one of the things

00:25:22.530 --> 00:25:24.750
