over the last couple of years,

00:25:24.750 --> 00:25:27.760
because that news cycle
and that endless scroll,

00:25:27.760 --> 00:25:29.360
everyone calls it doom scrolling,

00:25:29.360 --> 00:25:31.210
where it's just more and
more and more and more,

00:25:31.210 --> 00:25:34.620
it's actually, it's making people crazy.

00:25:34.620 --> 00:25:36.110
- It is, it is making people crazy.

00:25:36.110 --> 00:25:38.010
And I discussed some of
the data in the book.

00:25:38.010 --> 00:25:39.940
What we're seeing,
especially with young people,

00:25:39.940 --> 00:25:43.410
we're seeing startling correlation
