use and depression, isolation

00:25:47.850 --> 00:25:49.990
anxiety, and suicide.

00:25:49.990 --> 00:25:53.010
It's really, the statistics
are really, really alarming.

00:25:53.010 --> 00:25:54.950
And again, it's particular, this is true,

00:25:54.950 --> 00:25:57.360
the depression piece of it's
true for people of all ages

00:25:57.360 --> 00:26:00.140
