00:26:02.310 --> 00:26:03.980
that social media use

00:26:03.980 --> 00:26:06.360
and then the correlation
between that and depression

00:26:06.360 --> 00:26:08.730
and even suicide is really stark.

00:26:08.730 --> 00:26:11.180
And this is something that we
need to get out into the open

00:26:11.180 --> 00:26:13.900
