00:51:19.920 --> 00:51:22.797
But I think the ball's
in his court on that.

00:51:22.797 --> 00:51:24.160
- Sorry, I got one more for you

00:51:24.160 --> 00:51:28.840
which is a question I often
get from my audience which is,

00:51:28.840 --> 00:51:30.160
are you hopeful?

00:51:30.160 --> 00:51:31.020
Do you actually,

00:51:31.020 --> 00:51:32.570
'cause we've talked about
some serious stuff here,

00:51:32.570 --> 00:51:34.040
I mean, the big tech threat,

00:51:34.040 --> 00:51:36.000
the ever expanding government threat,

00:51:36.000 --> 00:51:38.330
the wokeism threat
rampaging the institutions.

00:51:38.330 --> 00:51:40.640
I mean, this is serious stuff,

00:51:40.640 --> 00:51:44.120
but you're in the middle of
the fight, are you hopeful?

00:51:44.120 --> 00:51:44.953
- I am hopeful.

00:51:44.953 --> 00:51:46.240
I am hopeful and I'll tell you why.

00:51:46.240 --> 00:51:49.320
It's because I firmly, firmly believe

00:51:49.320 --> 00:51:52.320
that if you go to the
heart of this country

00:51:52.320 --> 00:51:54.760
if you go to the working
people of this country,

00:51:54.760 --> 00:51:56.970
if you go to the working
families of this country

00:51:56.970 --> 00:51:58.480
you'll find strength there.

00:51:58.480 --> 00:51:59.780
Our people are strong.

00:51:59.780 --> 00:52:02.880
Our families are strong, our
working folks are strong,

00:52:02.880 --> 00:52:04.190
they're strong in spirit,

00:52:04.190 --> 00:52:07.040
they're strong in their
convictions about our constitution

00:52:07.040 --> 00:52:09.480
and about our country,
they're not the problem.

00:52:09.480 --> 00:52:12.350
The problem is the leadership
class, that's the problem.

00:52:12.350 --> 00:52:15.530
If the situation were reversed,
I'd be really worried.

00:52:15.530 --> 00:52:17.950
But I think that the great
majority of this country,

00:52:17.950 --> 00:52:19.400
the great middle of this country

00:52:19.400 --> 00:52:21.190
and I don't mean just
middle geographically,

00:52:21.190 --> 00:52:24.230
I mean, the middle of
our society is strong,

00:52:24.230 --> 00:52:25.900
that's where the strength is.

00:52:25.900 --> 00:52:27.150
That's what we've got to do.

00:52:27.150 --> 00:52:30.290
That's why, what we have
to do are advanced policies

00:52:30.290 --> 00:52:33.100
that give more opportunity,
that bring more strength

00:52:33.100 --> 00:52:35.720
to the middle of our country
and give them a greater voice

00:52:35.720 --> 00:52:37.280
because they're the ones

00:52:37.280 --> 00:52:38.997
who are gonna be able to
lead this country forward.

00:52:38.997 --> 00:52:41.400
And what we've gotta do is
that the leadership class,

00:52:41.400 --> 00:52:43.200
which has become
increasingly out of touch,

00:52:43.200 --> 00:52:45.710
increasingly corrupt,
we've gotta replace them

00:52:45.710 --> 00:52:48.130
and we've gotta give
more power to the middle.

00:52:48.130 --> 00:52:50.210
- Well, the book actually got published.

00:52:50.210 --> 00:52:52.400
It is called "The Tyranny of Big Tech" .

